From cc075e11cb10c9bf66adcaf8670da0cc9792c6d4 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leo Rodarte <leorodarte07@gmail.com>
Date: Sat, 19 Sep 2026 23:45:15 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 09/41] canvas-noise

Canvas 2D curve/style noise pipeline, with the shared deterministic-noise
hash in platform/graphics so gradient.cc can use it without depending on
modules/.
---
